OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FToday, a strong westerly wind
OL,6,Fwill bring a mix of sunny spells and
OL,7,Ffrequent showers, particularly for
OL,8,Fnorthern hills. Some of these may be
OL,9,Fheavy. Despite the sunny spells, brisk
OL,10,Fwinds will make it feel colder than
OL,11,Fyesterday.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe strong winds and showers
OL,14,Fwill ease to bring a settled night,
OL,15,Falthough the odd light shower may
OL,16,Flinger. Clear spells and light winds
OL,17,Fwill allow for a chilly night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
